  "post_title": "El col·legi Baltasar Rull d'Onda celebra les I Jornades d'Inclusió",
  "post_date": "2017-05-27 13:38:24",
  "post_name": "el-col%c2%b7legi-baltasar-rull-donda-celebra-les-i-jornades-dinclusio",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Educación|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>(115 fotos) El col&middot;legi Baltasar Rull d&#39;Onda, declarat des de 2015 Centre d&#39;Escolaritzaci&oacute; d&#39;Alumnat Mot&ograve;ric, ha celebrat les I Jornades d&#39;Inclusi&oacute; de dimecres 24 a divendres 26 de maig. Les ha clausurades la directora general d&#39;Inclusi&oacute; Social de la Generalitat, Helena Ferrando.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/05/P1600674.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Les activitats han anat des del zumba fins a una xerrada del nadador paral&iacute;mpic d&#39;Artesa Pepe Ramos Castillo, passant pel desdejuni saludable, que organitza l&#39;Ajuntament tamb&eacute; en es altres centres educatius d&#39;Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesinclussiocolebaltasarrullonda17/p1600355.jpg\" alt=\"p1600355\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesinclussiocolebaltasarrullonda17/p1600356.jpg\" alt=\"p1600356\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesinclussiocolebaltasarrullonda17/p1600357.jpg\" alt=\"p1600357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesinclussiocolebaltasarrullonda17/p1600358.jpg\" alt=\"p1600358\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesinclussiocolebaltasarrullonda17/p1600359.jpg\" alt=\"p1600359\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesinclussiocolebaltasarrullonda17/p1600360.jpg\" alt=\"p1600360\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesinclussiocolebaltasarrullonda17/p160036